  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      339.67,
      455.36,
      367.77
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This Clause amends paragraphs (e) and (f) of section 3 of the Fiscal Manage-ment (Responsibility) Act, No. 3 of 2003 and the legal effect of this section as amended isto amend the objectives underlying responsible fiscal management of the government,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.27,
      378.11,
      455.28,
      405.93
    ],
    "text": "(a) by increasing the percentage of the gross domestic product of the currentfinancial year along with the two preceding financial years mentioned inparagraph (e), from 4.5 percentum to 7 percentum; and;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.27,
      416.03,
      455.35,
      462.93
    ],
    "text": "(b) by changing the financial years mentioned in paragraph (f) as \u201cJanuary 1, 2013\u201dand \u201cJanuary 1, 2020\u201d respectively and by reducing the target set in relation tothe percentage of total liabilities of the government, to be achieved at the endof the financial year commencing on January 1, 2013, from eighty five percentum to eighty per centum.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
