    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.4,
      288.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      301.49,
      401.42,
      337.43
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Fiscal Management(Responsibility) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shallbe deemed to have come into operation from January 1, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      350.69,
      401.38,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Fiscal Management (Responsibility)Act, No. 3 of 2003 is hereby amended as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      181.05,
      387.65,
      401.4,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "(a) in paragraph (e) of that section, by the substitution,for the figures and words \u201c4.5 per centum ;\u201d; of thefigures and words \u201c7 per centum ;\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      181.05,
      436.85,
      401.4,
      497.39
    ],
    "text": "(b) in paragraph (f) of that section, by the substitution,for the words and figures \u201cJanuary 1, 2006\u201d, \u201ceighty-five per centum\u201d and \u201cJanuary 1, 2013\u201d, of the wordsand figures \u201cJanuary 1, 2013\u201d, \u201ceighty per certum\u201dand \u201cJanuary 1, 2020\u201d respectively.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      510.37,
      401.41,
      533.44
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
